body:
Updated to 4.6 and problem still persists.

@maxencevahedi I tried both baking and manually placing occluders. Crashing still happens. Even in a scene that has nothing but a parent Node3D node and a OccluderInstance3D node. As soon as the OccluderInstance has some kind of an occlusion mesh in it, the crash happens with about 75-80 % chance.

For now I can get away with turning Occlusion Culling off in editor and turning it on when I make a build.
